/Title (Traditional ESG reporting systems rely heavily on corporate disclosures or estimated sustainability metrics. As a result, many environmental activities occurring at the community level remain unmeasured and excluded from global ESG frameworks.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2150 0 R
/Prev 2630 0 R
/Next 2640 0 R
>>
endobj
